    "Equipment Value containing NUL supplies Receive evidence only with Type0 and no extra children; empty/NUL-free values and later identity relations retain existing behavior.",
    "Complete shared-budget root/group scans verify unique vendor-zero group/type/value instances, exact flags, four-byte type0 and the selected NUL-containing value.",
