    "Wrong type with NUL-containing value retains its prior unsupported classification; the old isolated type diagnostic remains covered independently.",
    "Structural and earlier wire/group failures retain priority, while later request constraints remain later. Reordering the equipment group after a malformed service group preserves first-failure order.",
